cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Reproduction Code and Data for “Cycles with Exactly Two Amplifications in GCD-Augmented Fibonacci Recurrences”"
authors:
  - family-names: Hawarey
    given-names: Mosab
    affiliation: Geospatial Research
version: 1.1.1
date-released: 2026-11-14
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/mhawarey/two-amplification-cycles-gcd-fibonacci"
abstract: >-
  Reproduction code for the paper "Cycles with Exactly Two Amplifications in
  GCD-Augmented Fibonacci Recurrences" by Mosab Hawarey (2026). The script
  verifies the twenty-five known cycles of the cofactor map with exactly two
  amplifications (Table 1 of the paper) from their defining triples, and
  reproduces the residue covering modulo 2, 3, 5 and 7, the census of all
  patterns with cycle multiplier L_q, the exclusion of cycles with G > L_q
  for periods up to 36, and the census of small seeds. The archive includes
  the factorizations of the Lucas numbers used in the paper, with every prime
  factor proved prime, and the twenty-five cycles in full. Version 1.1.1
  differs from version 1.1.0 only in labels, which now follow the numbering
  of the paper (Theorems 7 and 11).
keywords:
  - gcd-augmented Fibonacci recurrence
  - cofactor map
  - cycles
  - Lucas numbers
  - Collatz-type cycles
